  NodeId: youngBoy_15_badEnding
  SpeakerName: 'Bad Ending: Crushed Dreams'
  SpeakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69db653b1f999eb44866dccb33e341e1, type: 3}
  DialogueText: You wave your hands around the air accompanied by whooshing sound
    effects, ending with your hands spreading apart as you make an explosion sound.
    Try as you did to fake a spell, the boy sees through your ruse and is visibly
    upset. Tears in his eyes, he kicks you hard in the shin before running and sobbing
    as you clutch your leg in pain. And you deserve it. Monster.
